	(text "CARD ZERO -- the DIP switch, slot 0 (0x4000-0x47FF). Split out of dino_v0_0_2 2026-09-12;\nreferences unchanged (U76, SWITCH-GATE1, SW1, R17-R24, C48, C81) so PHASE_E.md still reads.\nTakes off the bus: ~{IO_RD_Q}, M11-M13, W0-7, +5V, GND. Gives back nothing (CARD-2).\nSlot decode is U76 on M11-M13, enabled by ~{IO_RD_Q} as built. +/-12V draw: none."
